description = "A port of the Flycast Dreamcast emulator to libretro, built here as the additional MLP1 AArch64 performance choice. It is the April 2022 Flycast source with cached texture anisotropy, a single final texture min-filter assignment, lazy common-uniform shader updates, Cortex-A55 tuning, LTO and a frozen profile-guided optimization dataset. Besides Dreamcast, the core supports the NAOMI, NAOMI 2 and Atomiswave arcade platforms with the appropriate BIOS images. This MLP1 build targets OpenGL ES on the Miniloong Pocket 1 and is not a drop-in replacement for the standard Flycast cores."
